Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:02.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是你不好 是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.37,0:00:09.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為你背叛了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:13.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:25.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳…梅琳她為什麼要…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:29.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不可能 她不會做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:30.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭也是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.41,0:00:34.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這些 肯定是哪裡搞錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:37.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會有這麼荒謬的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:38.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:01:01.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要消除戰爭 真正地…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.37,0:03:00.62,Title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur(5.0)}新的旗帜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:09.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,離最後答覆時限還有5小時
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來還是不太可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:16.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能不用戰鬥當然最好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:22.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,42-Destiny 666-Legend的預備來福槍 配置在二號倉庫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:27.19,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(641.6,628.4)}{\fad(500,500)}地球聯合軍 最高司令部 Heaven's Base
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.71,0:03:26.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,C18-31閘門現在開始封鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快開始最終檢查
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.40,0:03:32.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全區域疏散F級別地下設施
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:34.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入最終防禦狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第七機動軍團完成部署
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:40.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,30分鐘後開始Nibelungen的能量傳輸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.89,0:03:43.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發出最後通牒等待回音嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:48.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾現在心情一定很好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:52.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但光靠這些真的能守得住嗎 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:56.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,防守? 您在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:59.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是要反攻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.83,0:04:01.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從此時此刻開始
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.65,0:04:05.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,推翻我們就能結束戰爭從此天下太平?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.37,0:04:12.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會那麼輕易被這種話矇騙 那些民眾的確有夠愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:18.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但正因為這樣我們才必須不惜一切代價回擊他們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:23.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在發生真正無法挽回的事之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.81,0:04:28.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個世界被他們協調者據為己有之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:30.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:35.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,推翻我們只不過是換成他們而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:44.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們大家都知道沒有正義的使者和像神一樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.96,0:04:48.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,準備完成後就開始
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:52.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長大人能囂張的日子也快結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:56.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還裝腔作勢跑來前線
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:05:02.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓他在另一個世界好好後悔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:06.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.76,0:05:08.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然很不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.13,0:05:14.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道我能不能像真一樣用得那麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:15.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:19.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是被Logos所騙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.83,0:05:21.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭和梅琳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她根本不是那種人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:28.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳 阿斯蘭也肯定…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:33.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那場大戰後沒去奧布的話
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:35.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.70,0:05:39.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭他太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:43.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,背叛了所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.01,0:05:48.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是傻瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:53.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我不會認輸的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:01.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以真也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:14.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜 露娜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:32.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:40.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:45.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我絕對會保護Impulse
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:54.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是Heaven's Base上空
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.13,0:07:00.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離狄蘭達爾發出的最後答覆時限還剩3小時多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.68,0:07:04.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但至今為止聯合軍仍未作出任何答覆
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:07.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如過了規定時限
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:11.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為最高指揮官的狄蘭達爾議長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:14.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,將親自率領ZAFT和對Logos同盟軍
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:18.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始展開對Heaven's Base的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡除了基地設施之外
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:21.84,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(944,665.2)}{\blur6}奧布 內閣府官邸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:21.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還擁有眾多軍工廠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是聯合軍的一大據點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.05,0:07:28.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各補給班開始銜接112號部件
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:34.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦開戰 對雙方來說都將是一場慘烈的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全軍部署完成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:41.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.01,0:07:45.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但真的要…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:49.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所謂先下手為強 反正都是要打了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:52.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對方可能還以為把我們逼入絕境了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事實上並非如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.15,0:07:57.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全軍開始攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:06.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵軍發射導彈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:08.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.94,0:08:25.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始攻擊 MA隊 MS隊出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:28.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第二第三機動軍團出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:30.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全武器系統開保險
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.71,0:08:33.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第七第十五防衛中隊出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:38.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS MA群接近 開始攻擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會 至今未作任何答覆…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是發生了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:45.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Heaven's Base開始攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.66,0:08:48.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在未作出任何答覆甚至宣戰的前提下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:50.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卻開始攻擊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:54.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,生體CPU同步率87%
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.22,0:08:55.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,系統全部正常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.73,0:08:57.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,X-1 Destroy出擊準備就緒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.55,0:09:01.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來 上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:22.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:28.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.16,0:09:38.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以 別動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:44.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你…死…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:45.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:48.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都還活著
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:56.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.93,0:09:58.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,同型機5台確認
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:01.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那東西有5台?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.63,0:10:31.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然有這種事 吉普利爾這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:32.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長 這樣下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:34.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:38.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迫不得已 我們也立刻開始戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:39.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:41.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:43.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,準備總體戰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.20,0:10:51.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Ragnarok作戰計劃開始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.39,0:10:54.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空降部隊立刻出發
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.83,0:11:15.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:26.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,興師問罪也好 理想也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.24,0:11:30.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只有勝利後才有意義
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:35.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為遠古開始就注定勝利者擁有一切
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:40.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正上方檢測出ZAFT空降艇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:42.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從路線26向31展開
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.07,0:11:44.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Nibelungen準備發射
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:45.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.87,0:11:49.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從現在開始解除Nibelungen的安全裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:51.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發出撤離命令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迷彩閘門開啓
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.51,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1043.2,665.2)}{\fad(500,0)}{\blur(5.5)}對空掃蕩砲 Nibelungen
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:06.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,照射角從20到32
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:09.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Nibelungen完成發射準備
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:13.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:30.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…這種…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.33,0:12:40.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:41.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空降部隊被消滅
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:44.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做出這種東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:46.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡的Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:48.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 我要出擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:49.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請快下令出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.10,0:12:50.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.47,0:12:53.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事無法饒恕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:54.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:55.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:13:00.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny Legend Impulse出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:04.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  Destiny出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.27,0:13:07.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:09.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始出擊程序
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.07,0:13:13.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閘門開啓 彈射系統的連接確認完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:16.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射器啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:18.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射推進力正常
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:19.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,路線清空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:21.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny 請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  Destiny出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:30.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Legend 請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:33.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路  Legend出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:42.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,核心戰機 請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:48.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 霍克  核心戰機出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:09.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,果然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.34,0:14:19.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管嘴上怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.97,0:14:23.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要勝過聯合的規模和物資可不是那麼容易的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:27.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上次大戰中失去了Joshua
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.72,0:14:30.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但還有Heaven's Base
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.32,0:14:33.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且就算萬一再失去這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:36.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合還有月球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.45,0:14:42.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾的演說的確讓人大吃一驚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但結果到最後還是聯合的勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.36,0:14:50.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們選擇的道路果然是正確的 父親
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:56.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下只希望能就此打倒狄蘭達爾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.82,0:14:58.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那一切就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:01.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 這些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.09,0:15:07.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還想為所欲為嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:20.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.88,0:15:22.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奇薩卡先生帶你來的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:24.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也吃了一驚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:27.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉哭個不停
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:30.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一直到剛才還在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:39.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也辦得到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:43.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太莽撞了 露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,飛在天上下面也會打上來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳 她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊 她沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:15:59.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你保護了她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.15,0:16:01.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然現在還在睡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:03.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她的情況比你好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.65,0:16:26.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 總之幹掉那東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:27.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能殺出一條路嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.27,0:16:29.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:49.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙 可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.23,0:16:54.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是…你們也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:58.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,厭惡遺傳基因操縱的聯合和Blue Cosmos
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:04.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,使用藥物和其他各種手段製造出的活著的兵器
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:06.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為戰鬥而生的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.04,0:17:10.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定期間內如果不進行某種特殊處理
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:13.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎會無法維持身體機能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.77,0:17:19.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:32.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹這種事 幹這種事的傢伙們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.73,0:17:33.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:38.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:47.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為有你們世界才會…！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:52.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:57.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害 真又來了 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.33,0:18:00.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們也很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,利用這段時間重整旗鼓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:04.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:08.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我來開路
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.10,0:18:10.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS隊跟上來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:22.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:33.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是為什麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:42.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想保護…卡嘉莉…基拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:45.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…想發揮力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:46.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:50.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長知道這些
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:54.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第二防線被突破
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:56.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵MS進入灣內
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:19:00.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那三台是什麼東西 調Destroy去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.80,0:19:02.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,集中攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:04.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二號機被擊毀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.87,0:19:05.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:20.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 換劍鬥裝備
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:23.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用Excalibur 也給雷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:24.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:28.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.57,0:19:30.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.57,0:19:32.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在別說話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:36.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.27,0:19:39.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 先睡一會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.72,0:19:45.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們隨時都還有機會說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:13.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹得好 露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:15.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,很有一套嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.89,0:20:18.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你忘了嗎 我也是紅衣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.89,0:20:20.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,三號機重度破損
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.77,0:20:39.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:46.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一號機被擊毀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:48.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾 這樣下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:51.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.07,0:20:56.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:11.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 我也能和任何敵人戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.45,0:21:13.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊瓦諾隊來電
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:15.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認司令部掛起白旗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.09,0:21:18.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人似乎沒有戰鬥意志
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.13,0:21:20.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進行確認
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.40,0:21:21.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.09,0:21:24.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,完全停戰前不要放鬆警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:25.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:28.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣…只要幹掉它就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.42,0:21:30.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全部
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.74,0:21:42.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.83,0:21:43.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.24,0:21:45.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又睡著了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:47.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:49.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:52.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 戰鬥方面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.05,0:21:56.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還不清楚 但看來是聯合輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:21:58.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.51,0:22:08.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們到底在幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:17.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界還…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.57,0:23:26.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各自擁有的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:27.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.47,0:23:30.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法放手的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:46.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士高達SEED Destiny 天空的基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:49.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從漆黑的宇宙中 復活吧 Freedom
